# 文本在仓库和工作区都使用 LF，避免 core.autocrlf 在下次检出时把 LF 改成 CRLF。
* text=auto eol=lf

# 二进制资源不做换行转换。后写的规则覆盖上面的 text=auto。
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.mp3 binary
*.wav binary
*.ogg binary
*.zip binary
*.pyc binary
*.bin binary
*.fbx binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.pvr binary
*.astc binary
*.skel binary
*.DS_Store binary
